[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_7p6hl"]
script = ExtResource("2_qclhi")
lines = "The temple is dedicated to the God of Ways. Normally, it would be filled with all manner of guests and travellers seeking blessings or divine guidance for their journeys. At the moment however, the space is occupied by the sick and wounded, tended to by healers and volunteers.
The wounded all seem to have sustained grievous injuries. Whether they were mauled by beasts, or savaged by bandits, you cannot say.
The sick appear to be separated from the wounded, relegated to a cordoned off area in the back. A censer sits in the middle of that area, emanating smoke that smells sharply of herbs and resin."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://qiibr5iabuqw"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_sfsyt"]
script = ExtResource("2_qclhi")
lines = "One of the volunteers approaches you. She appears to be a local hedge witch or wise woman, likely pitching in to help the healers. \"You both look well. Are you here to lend a hand?\" she asks.
You explain that you are here to help, in a manner of speaking, to which she scoffs. \"Well, miasma's not something you can hold at sword point. I think fighting off the undead is more your speed,\" she says. Seeing your furrowed brow at the mention of miasma, she explains for your benefit.
\"The mist has been thick and heavy of late, and it carries sickness with it, Lung Rot to be exact. It's a deep kind of sick, a death that takes its time.\""
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://qiibr5iabuqw"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_tlm8x"]
script = ExtResource("2_qclhi")
lines = "The woman looks at you, up and down. \"You lot seem loaded for bear, ready for a fight. I don't think we have much to offer you, aside from herb bundles. They keep the Lung Rot at bay. The herbs are common enough, but we've been going through a lot of them lately.\"
She gestures to your pack. \"I don't have many to spare, but I'm willing to trade supplies for supplies. Your rations for our herbs,\" she explains."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://qiibr5iabuqw"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_cb1uq"]
script = ExtResource("2_qclhi")
lines = "Relief and gratitude wash over her features. \"Thank you, these will go a long way to getting people back on their feet. The weakness after the Lung Rot leaves you can be just as deadly as the sickness itself.\"
She hands over the Fragrant Herbs, two bundles of herbs wrapped in a strip of linen, meant to be tied over the mouth and nose."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://qiibr5iabuqw"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_ah3my"]
script = ExtResource("3_ss58i")
title = "Accept the trade"
events = Array[ExtResource("1_hr1w6")]([SubResource("Resource_cb1uq")])
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://dkfdnmlrdhh5u"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_jmbsy"]
script = ExtResource("2_qclhi")
lines = "She purses her lips for a moment. \"Very well, that is your choice to make. But do be careful if you decide to brave the mists. As I said, there is something unnatural about those vapors...\""
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://qiibr5iabuqw"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_y3on8"]
script = ExtResource("3_ss58i")
title = "Decline the trade"
events = Array[ExtResource("1_hr1w6")]([SubResource("Resource_jmbsy")])
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://dkfdnmlrdhh5u"

